{"3760600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CarCam", "steam_appid": 3760600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏎️ CarCam - Childhood Chaos on Four Tiny Wheels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember when the living room was your racetrack, the sofa your mountain, and your RC car your best friend? CarCam brings that magic back, throwing you into a larger-than-life world, seen through the tiny lens of a remote-controlled car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📹 Step into a toy-sized universe where everything is oversized and full of opportunity.<br>From wild races to chaotic minigames, every corner of the room hides a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚗 Pick your mode. Own the floor.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race - Drift around table legs and launch off cushions in high-speed challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domination - Steal LEGO bricks, hold control zones, and outsmart rival teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billiard - Smash into balls (and each other!) in this bonkers, car-fueled twist on the pool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Roam - No rules, no rush. Just explore, drift, and vibe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Play solo, local, or online – but watch out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grumpy house owner doesn’t like surprises… especially four-wheeled ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✨ CarCam isn’t just a game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the thrill of childhood rediscovered.<br>The joy of turning a simple room into your personal playground.<br>And the freedom to race like nobody’s watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and bring the chaos home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏎️ CarCam - Childhood Chaos on Four Tiny Wheels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re